{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213390","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213390","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1521339001:0":{"text":"Finally, we've got what we need.","source_cn":"太好了，终于有麻药可用了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBADE196750AE8DF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521339002:0":{"text":"Thanks for your help. I'll start treating Marco now.","source_cn":"多谢你们的帮助。我马上就为马尔科进行治疗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB30330F85F00DEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521339003:0":{"text":"Let's hope... uh, some merciful goddess is watching over him.","source_cn":"愿神……呃，随便哪个怜悯的神，但愿能庇佑他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5844C70ED1DA9A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521339004:0":{"text":"The treatment might take a while. I'll stay here in case anything happens.","source_cn":"治疗恐怕会花费一段不短的时间。我会留在这里，以免发生意外。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8986096829E10F64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1521339004":{"text":"The treatment might take a while. I'll stay here in case anything happens.","source_cn":"治疗恐怕会花费一段不短的时间。我会留在这里，以免发生意外。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8986096829E10F64","variant_status":"","male"